      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also write a note for each recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时为每条录音写一篇笔记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always on in Heart mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心力模式下始终开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always on in Heart mode, over Bluetooth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心力模式下始终开启，经蓝牙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any OpenAI-compatible service works: llama.cpp (llama-server), Ollama or LM Studio on this Mac, or cloud services such as DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi and OpenAI. The API key is kept in your keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持任何 OpenAI 兼容服务：本机的 llama.cpp（llama-server）、Ollama、LM Studio，或 DeepSeek、通义千问、Kimi、OpenAI 等云端服务。API Key 保存在钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking the recorder to start its Wi‑Fi…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在让录音豆开启 Wi‑Fi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio deleted as set in Heart mode. The transcript is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频已按心力模式的设置删除，文字保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically check for updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动检查更新"
          }
