    "Clear all voice typing history?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空全部语音输入记录？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear history": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear history…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除记录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a sentence to play from there": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一句从那里开始播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a sentence to play from there. ⚑ is a moment you marked on the recorder; click it to play from the mark.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一句从那里开始播放。⚑ 是你在录音豆上做的重点标记，点它从标记处播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click in the box, press the recorder's button, wait for “Listening”, then speak. Press the button again to finish. The keyboard shortcut %@ does the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下下面的输入框，按录音豆的按键，看到「正在听」后开始说话，说完再按一下结束。快捷键 %@ 也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click, then press the keys. Use ⌘, ⌥ or ⌃ with a key, or an F key on its own. Esc cancels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下，再按下组合键。普通键要带 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃，F 键可以单独用；按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接录音豆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
