    "Notes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "笔记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes are named date-title.md. A note you have edited is never overwritten: OpenBean writes a new one next to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "笔记文件名为「日期-标题.md」。你改过的笔记不会被覆盖：OpenBean 会在旁边另写一份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "笔记文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing heard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有听到声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: agents get the diary and conversation summaries, not the words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，Agent 只能读到日记和对话段摘要，读不到原话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: only the diary is written. Notes already saved stay as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时只写日记。已经写好的笔记不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在录音豆上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On your recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在录音豆上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One Markdown file per recording with the summary and the transcript, for example in an Obsidian vault. Audio stays in the library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条录音一个 Markdown 文件，包含摘要和转写，例如放进 Obsidian 知识库。音频仍留在录音库里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One term per line: names, product names, jargon. OpenBean fixes same-sounding names and spelling to these without an LLM, in voice typing and in library transcripts (where only terms of three or more characters are fixed by sound); clean-up prefers them too. For a word it keeps mishearing, add what it hears after an equals sign: Claude Code = cloud code, 克劳德 code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一个词：人名、产品名、术语。不用大模型也会把读音相同的错字和英文写法改成这些词，语音输入和录音库的转写都用（转写里只按读音纠正三个字以上的词）；润色时也优先用它们。总被认错的词，在等号后面写上它被认成的样子：Claude Code = cloud code, 克劳德 code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only files OpenBean created for voice typing are deleted. Deleted audio can't be recovered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只删 OpenBean 为语音输入新建的文件，删了不能恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only needed for cloud services": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅云端服务需要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Bluetooth Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开蓝牙设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open OpenBean": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 OpenBean"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Privacy Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开隐私设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开系统设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open in Library": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在录音库里打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the conversation this comes from": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开出自的那段对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBean"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean disconnects and searches again. Nothing on the recorder changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBean 会断开并重新搜索，录音豆上的内容不会有任何改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean isn't allowed to use Bluetooth": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBean 没有蓝牙权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean keeps trying. If it doesn't connect in a minute, put the recorder back in its case and take it out again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBean 会一直重试。一分钟后还连不上，就把录音豆放回充电盒再拿出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenBean never pairs, unbinds, resets or updates the recorder. It deletes a recording from the recorder only when you ask and that recording is safely on this Mac, or, after voice typing, the file it created for that dictation (see Settings).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBean 不会对录音豆做配对、解绑、恢复出厂或固件升级；只在你要求、且录音已经完整保存在这台 Mac 上时删除录音豆上的录音，或在语音输入结束后删掉它为这次语音输入新建的文件（见设置）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Output": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Over Bluetooth, when the recorder connects or goes back in its case": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆连上或放回充电盒时，经蓝牙下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Over Wi‑Fi it takes about %@, but your Mac is offline meanwhile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用 Wi‑Fi 约 %@，期间 Mac 会断网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview of the day": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当天概述"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the configuration into your agent's mcpServers settings (Claude Desktop: Settings → Developer → Edit Config), or run the command in Terminal for Claude Code. Read-only: it can't change, delete or record anything, and can't reach audio or voice typing. It runs only while an agent starts it. The transcripts and summaries it reads go to the agent you connect and the model behind it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把配置粘贴到 agent 的 mcpServers 设置里（Claude Desktop：设置 → 开发者 → 编辑配置）；Claude Code 则在终端里运行上面这行命令。只读：不能修改、删除或录音，也读不到音频和语音输入记录。只在 agent 启动它时运行。它读到的转写和摘要会交给你连接的那个 agent 和它背后的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pauses and layout": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停顿与排版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
