    "Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recordings are still synced and transcribed; the diary and conversation summaries are written once the service is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音照常同步和转写；日记和对话段摘要会在服务恢复后补上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recordings from the recorder show up here by day after you sync them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆上录的音同步之后，会按天出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recordings made on the recorder come to this Mac and are transcribed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆上的录音会同步到这台 Mac，并在这里转成文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recordings you make on the recorder show up here after you sync them to this Mac with Sync in the toolbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在录音豆上录的音，用工具栏里的「同步」传到这台 Mac 后会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records on the recorder without voice typing — for meetings and notes. Sync it to the library afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只在录音豆上录音、不做语音输入，适合会议和随手记，之后可同步到录音库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刷新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relative to the notes folder, for example Diary or ../Journal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相对笔记文件夹，例如 日记 或 ../30-日记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes filler words, fixes likely homophones using your word list and keeps your wording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去掉口头禅，按个人词表纠正同音字，保留你的说法。"
