            "value": "由「润色」里设置的大模型服务生成标题、摘要、要点和待办事项；服务没开时跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To put text where your cursor is, macOS needs to let OpenBean send keystrokes. Turn on OpenBean under Privacy & Security → Accessibility (on some versions: Device Control and Data Access).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要把文字打进光标处，macOS 需要允许 OpenBean 发送按键。请在「隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能」（部分版本叫 Device Control and Data Access）里打开 OpenBean。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To-dos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待办"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today groups recordings by day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「今天」按天归整录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today groups recordings by day. With 4:00 AM, a conversation at 2 AM still counts as the day before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「今天」按天整理录音。设成凌晨 4 点时，凌晨两点的谈话算前一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too little was said on this day for a diary; the conversations are listed below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这天说的话太少，没有写日记；对话都列在下面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe recordings after download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载后自动转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribing %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写中 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribing on this Mac…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在本机转写…"
          }
        }
      }
